hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"9","Bismillāhi In the Name of Allah. Reference: At-Tirmidhi 2/505, among others. See 'Irwa'ul Ghalil no. 49 and Sahihul-Jami' 3/203"
"10","[Bismillāhi] Allāhumma 'innī 'a`ūdhu bika minal-khubthi walkhabā'ith. [In the Name of Allah]. O Allah, I seek protection in You from evil and the evil ones (or, from the evil male and female Jinn). Reference: Al-Bukhari 1/45, Muslim 1/283. The addition of Bismillah at its beginning was reported by Said bin Mansur. See Fathul-Bari 1/244"
